<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Wizard Eye</h1>
<p>Sphere: Mind Sphere
Class: Conjurer (guild level 23)
Mana: 20
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast wizard eye &lt;someone&gt;
cast wizard eye &lt;object&gt;
</pre>
<p>An image forms in your mind of what surrounds someone or something, anywhere 
in the world, as if you stood there yourself:
</p>
<ul><li>someone, or something lying in a room: you see that room, and who and what</li></ul>
<pre> is in it,
</pre>
<ul><li>an object inside a bag or box: you see what else is in it,</li>
<li>an object someone carries: you see what they carry.</li></ul>
<p>You can't cast it on yourself. You can cast it while resting, and it is also 
found on scrolls and wands.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Locate Person</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Locate Object</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Mind Sphere</a>
</pre>




</div>